WEBVTT

00:00:10.940 --> 00:00:19.320
A light so bright that it can't be hidden
Breaks the silence and resurrects in this world

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:30.070
The dry land quakes violently
Sparks clash as we risk our lives

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:37.790
Let a miracle occur, just one more time

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:44.950
The power to regain the pages of memories I lost long ago

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:53.020
The trusting heart pierces the darkness
Search for the place where the soul rests

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:59.250
The sharp glint in my unblinking eye burns

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:06.700
Two souls - light and shadow
To the future shown in the crystal

00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:13.310
Now moving  Overflowing in red  eyes

00:01:28.600 --> 00:01:32.310
Kaiba, you were fighting Zorc?

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:37.280
But even Ultimate Dragon couldn't defeat Zorc.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:44.020
I used my remaining Ba to fuse us into Dragon Master Knight and make a comeback.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:47.420
But we couldn't defeat Zorc.

00:01:47.420 --> 00:01:51.700
Partner, you're my only hope!

00:01:52.820 --> 00:01:58.830
In the Name of the Pharaoh!!

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.720
The light of hope…

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:27.040
That's right.  I can’t give up.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:31.470
For my friends who battle and believe me!

00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:32.760
You fool.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:41.140
Don’t you realize that it's humans who strengthen the darkness and give me infinite power?

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.260
What?

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:48.350
You can only know if you exist in the light by looking at your shadow.

00:02:48.350 --> 00:02:52.520
Darkness gives your life meaning.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:56.300
So humans will slaughter each other forever.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:59.780
That's human instinct.

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.780
That's the natural order of things!

00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:04.670
Be quiet!

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:09.830
I'll use my power to remake this world into a world of darkness.

00:03:09.830 --> 00:03:14.590
I’ll show you fools an endless hell!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.720
Be quiet!

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:25.760
Pharaoh, repent for your sins by falling into eternal darkness!

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:31.190
I can’t afford to be defeated...

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:38.960
Partner!

00:03:48.210 --> 00:03:49.840
My other self!

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.550
Yugi!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.980
Part...ner...

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:02.770
I know you're here to tell the Pharaoh his real name.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:04.700
But I won’t let you!

00:04:09.670 --> 00:04:11.040
My other self!

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:12.980
Yugi!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.410
Partner…  Everyone!

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.150
It's them!

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.580
They just don't give up!

00:04:27.550 --> 00:04:34.470
My other self, this Duel Disk is loaded with your deck.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:40.260
Each card carries a piece of our soul!

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:41.940
Partner…

00:04:44.960 --> 00:04:46.310
Here I go, Zorc!

00:04:47.460 --> 00:04:50.270
Come out, Dark Magician!

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:55.880
Mahad…

00:04:55.880 --> 00:05:01.670
Foreigners from another world, thank you for restoring my life!

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.060
Dark Magician!

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:06.130
I'm gonna fight too!

00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:07.990
Go!

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.300
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:05:12.310 --> 00:05:13.610
I'm fighting too!

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:14.800
Me too!

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.500
I summon Super Roboyarou!

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.300
I summon Fire Sorcerer!

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.790
That's their true identities!

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:44.930
Strike back, Dark Magician!

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:48.290
Go, Red-Eyes!

00:05:48.290 --> 00:05:49.890
Magical Shockwave!

00:05:49.890 --> 00:05:51.350
Black Fireball!

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:55.940
Fire Sorcerer!

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:57.440
Super Roboyarou!

00:06:06.550 --> 00:06:07.540
What?

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.560
Attack again!

00:06:23.950 --> 00:06:25.760
Are they immortal?

00:06:25.760 --> 00:06:27.610
They just keep coming!

00:06:27.610 --> 00:06:29.250
Master!

00:06:30.140 --> 00:06:32.220
Dark Magician Girl?

00:06:32.730 --> 00:06:33.650
Mana?

00:06:39.930 --> 00:06:43.120
She learned how to summon spirits!

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:46.200
Master!

00:06:46.200 --> 00:06:47.050
Mana!

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:53.450
Friends of the Prince, leave this to us and help the Prince!

00:06:54.300 --> 00:06:55.420
Thanks.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.000
Stop right there!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.410
Magical Shockwave!

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:03.220
Yugi!

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:04.140
Are you okay?

00:07:04.140 --> 00:07:05.190
Hang in there!

00:07:05.680 --> 00:07:07.300
My other self!

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:10.050
Partner...  Everyone...

00:07:10.050 --> 00:07:11.260
Can you stand?

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.850
Grab my shoulder.

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:15.670
I won't let you!

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:16.930
Mana!

00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:18.500
Yes, Master!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:21.210
Magical Shockwave!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:28.740
You annoying magicians!

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.750
Partner, did you find my name?

00:07:36.470 --> 00:07:37.680
Well...

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.610
Partner…

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:51.280
I see.  Even if you want to tell the Pharaoh his real name, you can't.

00:07:51.690 --> 00:07:52.470
What?

00:07:52.470 --> 00:07:58.560
They couldn't read the Pharaoh’s name beause it was written in hieroglyphics.

00:07:59.270 --> 00:08:00.680
Is that true?

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:06.850
I’m sorry, my other self.  Zorc's right.

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:11.110
I remember how those letters looked.

00:08:11.110 --> 00:08:15.920
But I don’t know how to convey them to you.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:22.560
Then let's defeat Zorc ourselves.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:23.190
Yeah!

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.130
Go, Red-Eyes!

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.520
Black Fireball!

00:08:30.890 --> 00:08:32.140
He's done for!

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:39.340
Honda!

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:44.380
You fools!  Vanish!

00:08:50.100 --> 00:08:51.830
Jonouchi!

00:09:02.910 --> 00:09:04.000
Anzu!

00:09:04.000 --> 00:09:08.320
When our monsters are destroyed, we lose life points.

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:12.850
If our life points reach 0, do we die?

00:09:12.850 --> 00:09:13.930
Everyone…

00:09:19.920 --> 00:09:22.740
Mana, we must release all our Heka.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:24.680
Is that okay with you?

00:09:25.000 --> 00:09:26.120
Yes!

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:28.560
Don’t do it, Mahad!

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.060
The result will always be the same.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.420
You cannot defeat me.

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:11.370
We're not strong enough to defeat Zorc.

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:16.030
Burn in the fires of hell!

00:10:16.030 --> 00:10:18.740
Zorc Inferno!

00:10:23.540 --> 00:10:25.450
I believe in you, Pharaoh!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.150
Prince!

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.610
Too bad, Pharaoh.

00:10:41.610 --> 00:10:44.470
But I'm willing to bury you with your friends.

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:52.840
Isn't there some way to tell Yugi his real  name?

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:14.020
It's over.  Give up.

00:11:16.220 --> 00:11:18.660
Zorc, I’ll never give up!

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:24.610
I know there has to be a way to tell my other self his real name!

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:25.980
Partner…

00:11:28.610 --> 00:11:29.710
That's...

00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:30.670
Yugi.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:33.320
Take this.

00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:35.390
What is it?

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.640
It’s a cartouche.

00:11:36.640 --> 00:11:42.690
When you regain your memories and remember your name, engrave it into that.

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:46.630
I know a way to tell him his real name!

00:11:46.630 --> 00:11:47.600
What?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.700
Think about those hieroglyphics.

00:11:51.550 --> 00:11:55.650
And imagine that they're inscribed on Yugi’s cartouche!

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:00.320
I see!

00:12:00.320 --> 00:12:02.320
This is a world of memories.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.140
What we wish for becomes real!

00:12:04.140 --> 00:12:08.080
Let's combine our powers into one!

00:12:08.080 --> 00:12:10.360
Okay!

00:12:17.280 --> 00:12:21.270
Die, Pharaoh!  Along with your friends from your memories!

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:33.510
Just a little more.  Keep it up!

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.180
Yugi...

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.080
Yugi...

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:39.100
Yugi!

00:12:39.990 --> 00:12:41.710
My other self!

00:12:41.710 --> 00:12:48.690
My powers of darkness will crush your final hope!

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:52.080
Ring of Defense!

00:12:57.070 --> 00:12:58.500
You?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.160
Don’t interfere!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:28.120
Partner!  Everyone!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.480
I have it!

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:39.020
Yugi...

00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:42.920
My other self…

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:47.570
The Pharaoh’s name is no longer sealed!

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:50.340
My name is… Atem!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:56.570
Atem?

00:13:56.570 --> 00:13:59.830
That's his real name.

00:14:01.710 --> 00:14:05.540
My son, God's name is justice.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.820
Father!

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.830
The Pharaoh is a God.

00:14:08.830 --> 00:14:12.770
For the Pharaoh's name, gather the three Gods!

00:14:13.400 --> 00:14:18.210
Zorc, our bond of friendship will awaken the Gods!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:37.230
Slifer the Sky Dragon!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.040
Obelisk the Tormentor!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.530
The Winged Dragon of Ra!

00:15:06.120 --> 00:15:07.510
Wow!

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.390
The three Gods are together!

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:13.100
The result will be the same.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.280
The three Gods are no match for me!

00:15:16.280 --> 00:15:20.900
In the name of the Pharaoh, I unite the Gods!

00:15:27.460 --> 00:15:28.780
What’s this?

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.700
It feels good.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:32.410
It's a gentle light.

00:15:33.180 --> 00:15:34.890
It's warm.

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:48.380
Holactie the Creator of Light!

00:15:49.420 --> 00:15:50.950
Holactie?

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:58.410
Darkness, be gone!

00:16:00.150 --> 00:16:00.950
Djoser!

00:16:09.950 --> 00:16:11.950
Take this!

00:16:40.460 --> 00:16:42.390
It died down.

00:16:47.440 --> 00:16:49.790
We're saved?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:55.860
The dark clouds are vanishing.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:00.740
You did it!

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.700
You defeated Zorc!

00:17:02.700 --> 00:17:03.540
Yeah.

00:17:03.540 --> 00:17:06.750
I knew you could do it, Yugi.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:09.390
Are you hurt, Yu-

00:17:10.640 --> 00:17:11.710
Oh yeah.

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:14.130
We shouldn't call you Yugi anymore.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:17.870
And I can't call you "my other self" either.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:20.570
Actually, let's keep it the same.

00:17:20.570 --> 00:17:21.260
No.

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:26.100
Your real name is Atem.

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:27.830
My real…

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:29.710
Atem…

00:17:30.410 --> 00:17:36.440
3,000 years ago, you couldn't defeat Zorc on your own.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:38.620
Holactie…

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:44.470
So you chose to seal yourself with Zorc..

00:17:44.470 --> 00:17:49.550
But this time, when Zorc resurrected...

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:54.990
You had friends to support and protect you.

00:17:54.990 --> 00:17:59.460
That was the power to defeat Zorc.

00:18:01.480 --> 00:18:07.740
What's impossible for one individual can be possible when everyone works together.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:13.930
Atem…  That sounds so strange…

00:18:13.930 --> 00:18:18.080
I‘ve shared the name “Yugi” with my partner.

00:18:18.080 --> 00:18:19.740
But it's different now.

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:24.120
Atem is my real name.

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:31.650
This means I’m me, and you’re you.

00:18:31.650 --> 00:18:34.560
I feel a little lonely, but this is for the best.

00:18:36.620 --> 00:18:38.890
Thank you, Anzu.

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:41.110
We won thanks to this cartouche.

00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:47.970
Partner, Honda, Jonouchi, Anzu.

00:18:47.970 --> 00:18:52.750
I was able to defeat Zorc because you found my name.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:54.390
Thank you!

00:18:55.160 --> 00:18:58.380
Don’t get so stiff, Atem.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.250
We're friends after all.

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:04.060
Your name may have changed, but not our relationship.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:05.380
Right.

00:19:06.400 --> 00:19:07.520
Kaiba…

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:08.750
Kaiba!

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:12.880
I can’t believe you came to this world.

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:16.430
Don’t call this a magic trick!

00:19:16.430 --> 00:19:19.840
There really are two Yugis.  Surprised?

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.620
Nothing surprises me anymore.

00:19:23.920 --> 00:19:28.320
For someone who hates the occult, you're taking this well.

00:19:28.320 --> 00:19:31.640
Stop talking like a know-it-all, amateur.

00:19:31.640 --> 00:19:33.670
Stop calling me that!

00:19:48.250 --> 00:19:50.050
The darkness is gone.

00:19:50.050 --> 00:19:53.180
But at a high price.

00:19:53.180 --> 00:19:58.160
Lives that were lost can never be replaced.

00:19:59.920 --> 00:20:07.180
Those who live must carry their light to create a brighter future.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:09.800
Seto.

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.660
I have a favor to ask.

00:20:12.660 --> 00:20:16.700
Succeed me and become the new Pharaoh.

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:19.130
W-What?

00:20:19.530 --> 00:20:22.080
Become the new Pharoah.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:24.490
How can you say that?

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.230
We risked our lives for you!

00:20:27.230 --> 00:20:30.160
I can no longer remain in this world.

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:35.210
I have no memories of what lies ahead.

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:37.810
Meaning I don't exist in this world.

00:20:37.810 --> 00:20:42.080
I’m out of time.  I must go.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:44.130
Pharaoh, your body is...

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:50.420
Faced with the Great Shadow Magus's temptations, you never lost the light in your soul.

00:20:50.420 --> 00:20:52.060
And defeated the darkness.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.230
The light in my soul…

00:20:56.000 --> 00:21:00.140
I leave you the Millennium Puzzle, proving you are the Pharaoh.

00:21:00.710 --> 00:21:04.950
Become the Pharaoh and rebuild this land.

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:06.880
Pharaoh…

00:21:07.340 --> 00:21:09.270
I'm counting on you, Seto.

00:21:16.640 --> 00:21:18.490
Are you ready?

00:21:18.490 --> 00:21:19.360
Yes.

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:22.600
Then let's go home!

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:35.680
Goodbye, Prince!

00:21:35.680 --> 00:21:38.440
Goodbye!

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:40.500
Pharaoh…

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:13.330
Right now, we don't need a map

00:22:13.490 --> 00:22:29.050
The miracle that tore through the darkness is in my hand

00:22:29.770 --> 00:22:34.890
Without a goal in mind

00:22:36.210 --> 00:22:43.460
We just step towards our dream

00:22:43.850 --> 00:22:49.100
EYE'S  As you sense it

00:22:49.290 --> 00:22:57.570
Your eye will find it

00:22:57.930 --> 00:23:03.380
Oh! EYE'S  What you wish for

00:23:04.170 --> 00:23:11.520
Will touch your soul

00:23:11.710 --> 00:23:14.780
In a duel

00:23:24.900 --> 00:23:27.890
Zorc was defeated, and the other-

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:32.200
I mean, Atem regained his memories.

00:23:32.200 --> 00:23:38.030
We return to the real world, meaning it's time to part with Atem.

00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:42.790
We knew this time would come, but does he really have to return to the afterlife?

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:48.860
As our boat heads to the Shrine of the Afterlife, Marik mentions a battle ritual.

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.410
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
The Final Test

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:53.410
Duel, standby!
